    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AMERICAN AIRLINES\nFLAGSHIP\nINFORMATION\nAmerica's Leading Airline",
      "FOR A MORE\nENJOYABLE FLIGHT\nIn this flight packet, you will find many\nthings of interest. For example, there is a\nmap for your use in locating your position\nfrom the air... a complete booklet that\nanswers practically all the questions you\nmay have about your Flagship and how it\nflies... postcards... and much more. This\npacket is for you, so why not take it with\nyou as a souvenir of your flight.\nHowever, there may be something you\nwant but don't see. If so, just push the call\nbutton and your stewardess will be at your\nside in a moment to fill your wish. If you\nwant to send a telegram, just ask her-she'll\ngive you the blanks and see that it's sent at\nthe next airport. She will also help you plan\nyour continuing or return trip with the aid\nof the In-Flight Reservations form in this\npacket. In fact, she will be a constant\nsource of assistance throughout the flight.\nOn the ground, as in the air, you'll find\nAMERICAN AIRLINes ready, and willing, to\nserve you whether it's planning a vacation\nin Mexico, or arranging to have a rental\ncar awaiting your arrival at the airport. All\nyou have to do is ask at any Reservations\nor Ticket Office. You will find AMERICAN\nAIrLINes a complete travel service with\nbut a single purpose - to make your trip\nmore enjoyable.\nAMERICAN AIRLINES\nFLAGSHIP\nINFORMATION\nAIRLINES\nA\nA\nAmerica's Leading Airline\nAA Form T106F\nLitho in U.S.A.",
      "-\nF 1112\nC-136C\nC-136C\nPrisiad in U.S. A.\nAA-T1278\nAIR MAN P\nAIR MAIL\nAMERICAN AIRLINES\nA N",
      "Al\nHEAR\nAIRLINES\nFLAGSHIP BOSTON",
      "WELCOME\nABOARD\nAMERICAN AIRLINES\nAN APIE",
      "FLY...\nthen\nRENT A CAR from\nHERTL\nAT DESTINATION\nTHE WORLD'S LARGEST\nHERTZ\nDRIV UR SELF\nSYSTEM\nWORLD TOREC\nA\nA",
      "MEMO\n10: The President\nf American Airlines\nre: Us",
      "EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 1953\nAMERICAN\nAIRLINES\nAMERICAN AIRLINES, Inc.\nAMERICAN AIRLINES DE MEXICO, S. A.\nCOMPLETE SYSTEM TIMETABLE\nA\nA\nYou'll really\nSAVE\nwhen you fly\nAmerican's\nDC-6 AIRtourist\nservice..\nCoast-to-Coast\n$99\nSee page 23 for\nother details\nAMERICA'S LEADING AIRLINE",
      "AMERICAN AIRLINES\nSystem Map\nA\nAmericas Leading Airline"
    ],
